OL,3,GNEWSAKatie Price messaged ex's rape
OL,4,Aaccuser, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Price messaged a teenage girl
OL,7,Fallegedly raped by her then-husband,
OL,8,Ftelling her: "I will make you a little
OL,9,Fstar," a court has heard.
OL,11,FPrice's ex-husband, Kieran Hayler, is
OL,12,Fon trial at Lewes Crown Court accused
OL,13,Fof three counts of rape and one count
OL,14,Fof sexual assault against the then
OL,15,F13-year-old girl in 2016 in West
OL,16,FSussex, all of which he denies.
OL,18,FJurors saw messages sent between Price
OL,19,Fand the girl, then aged 14, in which
OL,20,FPrice said she had heard Hayler and the
OL,21,Fgirl had kissed and that he had "tried
OL,22,Fit on" with her.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
