OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm only asking as this is a serious
OL,7,Fallegation," Price had then asked, to
OL,8,Fwhich the teenager replied that it was
OL,9,F"just a flirt thing" and that "nothing
OL,10,Fhappened".
